@{
    Layout = null;
    ViewData["Title"] = "Refund Policy — TruckTaxPro";
}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Refund Policy — TruckTaxPro</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@@600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/tabler-icons/2.44.0/iconfont/tabler-icons.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css">
    <style>
            .legal-hero {
                background: var(--ink);
                color: var(--cream);
                padding: 56px 48px 40px;
                text-align: center;
            }

                .legal-hero h1 {
                    font-size: 32px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                    margin-bottom: 8px;
                }

            .legal-body {
                max-width: 780px;
                margin: 0 auto;
                padding: 48px;
                font-size: 15px;
                line-height: 1.7;
                color: var(--steel);
            }

                .legal-body p {
                    margin-bottom: 16px;
                }

                .legal-body a {
                    color: var(--amber-dark);
                    font-weight: 600;
                }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <partial name="_Nav" />

    <section class="legal-hero">
        <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
    </section>

    <div class="legal-body">
        <p>We do not store any credit card information from our users. All information is collected in a secured site layer and sent directly to the credit processing agency.</p>

        <p>We are not responsible for double charges in case any error incident happens. Users or customers can directly email us at <a href="mailto:support@2290irstax.com">support@2290irstax.com</a>, referring to the Transaction ID, so that we can request a refund of double charges if any. Without a Transaction ID, it is not possible for us to identify your credit card transaction and refund the same. For refunds, it will take a minimum of 3 working days for us to process, refund, and notify our customer with the necessary refund information.</p>

        <p>Users are not allowed to delete any information after providing their business information. If this happens, the whole responsibility lies with the customer.</p>

        <p>We are always here to help genuine customers at any time with our quality services.</p>
    </div>

    <partial name="_Footer" />
</body>
</html>

